diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 5a3bc40..5ae7585 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,21 @@
+## 2026-11-11 — Codex, local integration change, not committed
+
+Local change, not committed — Codex: Maschine-enabled rack VST3/AU instrument and FX bridge, per-instance control ports and isolated G1_DATA_DIR support. Verified locally: instrument/FX VST3 two-instance control, host parameters, MIDI/audio, pause/resume, project state restore and plugin-only launcher; Both installed AU variants pass Apple auval; ten controller-launcher tests pass.
+
+- Queue bridge requests on the machine thread between bounded emulation slices; UI timer polls futures without waiting. Bound queues, cancel disconnected-client work, marshal native Settings callback to the UI thread and guard bridge task lifetime.
+
+- Encoder follow-up: coalesced live values use verified editor parameter frames on the existing PC Port/PresetsLink, with known patch IDs and patch-operation barriers; preserve Function hold gating and the ADC fallback until identity is known. Bridge RPC poll is 5ms. Verification recorded by the integrating repository; no external editor sync claim.
+
+- Optional G1_MK3_PORT loopback controller bridge for the Apple Silicon standalone, reusing existing KnobMap/PresetsLink and leaving DirectLink available to NME. Includes real-host verification helper and completed-settings ACK ownership fix (retain late-reply filtering for abandoned reads). Verified on macOS arm64: standalone/helper builds, settings-reply regression, G1 DSP check, local rack OS 3.03 upload/store/reload, actual knob feedback, CoreAudio opened, recorded E4/E5 and level change. No new physical MK3 control or external-editor sync claim.
+
+- Browser follow-up: expose existing PresetsLink upload outcome in controller status for confirmed file loading/failure feedback. Verified real-ROM local file selection/upload, actual changed knob values, rendered browser list and stored-bank reload on macOS arm64; controller regression tests cover upload failure/timeout.
+
+- MK3 assignments: real master ADC/output gain and synth-settings read/write metadata, held Function/Shift input with disconnect release, and a callback opening the existing standalone Settings card. Verified macOS arm64 standalone/helper builds, actual ROM Function gating, master ADC, synth tempo readback and controller mapping/layout/state checks. Native Settings opens the existing card; no replacement editor.
+
+- MK3 LCD text: preserve G1 custom lowercase descenders instead of blanking control bytes. Verified real-ROM gjpqy LCD byte codes; added standalone text regression target.
+
+- MK3 voice indicator: read requested polyphony using the existing Patch Header query path, separate from the active-slot allocation shown by the LCD. No page/preset counters substituted.
+
